        "title": "Add a switch to disable \"top sites\"",
        "body": "My personal reasoning for this is just annoyance; the main page of an app I use for extended periods of time, changing based on what I've been browsing, annoys me.\r\n\r\nHowever, there is also a privacy issue at play: an eavesdropper can see what you've been browsing if they manage to look at your screen when you open a new tab.\r\n\r\nI understand that for a lot of people this may be a wanted feature. I just don't see why it can't be toggled on and off. So, please, add such an option to this otherwise awesome app.\r\n\r\nThank you.",
